{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12232050","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12232050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1223205001:1":{"text":"젠장, 물귀신을 도와서 사람을 괴롭혀? 이 사실을 모두에게 알리겠어!","source_cn":"可恶，你们居然帮水鬼欺负我，我要告诉所有人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAA5014388CEAEBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1223205002:1":{"text":"왜곡하지 마세요. 뭐가 됐든 일을 시켰으면 제대로 돈을 내야죠!","source_cn":"别颠倒是非，既然他给你干了活，不管怎样，你要付干活的钱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32860A47718028B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1223205003:1":{"text":"지금까지 있었던 일 하고는 별개의 문제라고요.","source_cn":"至于之前的恩怨，那是另一回事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9CBC5F02E588710","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1223205004:1":{"text":"맞아요! 치피는 사적인 복수를 제일 싫어해요. 공정하게 해결하는 게 바로 기사의 미덕이라고요!","source_cn":"没错，满满最讨厌公报私仇。一码归一码，才是骑士的美德！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFE282C7121E8011","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1223205005:1":{"text":"거짓말로 우리를 해치려고 하나면, 당신들을 블러디 로즈에게 넘기겠어요! 그들은 악당을 공정하게 심판하니까요!","source_cn":"你要是栽赃陷害，我们就把你送去血薇帮，他们会给恶人公平...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38D1B87B057C23E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1223205006:1":{"text":"아, 안돼! 방금은 그냥 장난이었어. 여기 물귀신에게 약속한 보수가 있으니까, 아니, 그냥 전부 다 줄게!","source_cn":"别！我刚才跟你们开玩笑呢，这是答应给水鬼的钱，啊不，全...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBA051830823D9A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1223205007:0":{"text":"이, 이렇게 많이?!","source_cn":"这、这么多？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9D05D36C8C5EF1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1223205008:1":{"text":"솔로, 받아야 할 만큼만 받아.","source_cn":"梭罗，只拿该拿的那一份。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC1CC2168E9C3C71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1223205009:0":{"text":"하, 하지만... 공짜로 주는데 왜? 물귀신은 받아야 할 걸 전부 다 챙겨야 한다고 형님이 가르쳐 줬잖아?","source_cn":"可、可是……不拿白不拿，水鬼就该连拿带兜，这不是你教我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0A4A8138DAE97C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1223205010:1":{"text":"그건 우리가 강도였을 때 얘기지. 지금은 상황이 달라졌잖아?","source_cn":"那是做劫匪的时候，和现在能一样吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB477C7E4E2992C89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1223205011:1":{"text":"그래, 알았어. 새로운... 삶을 위해서!","source_cn":"行吧，听你的，为了……新生活！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEAA5A8A0A5FE3CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1223205012:1":{"text":"이봐! 이 더러운 돈 가져가! 우린 이제 강도가 아니라고. 받아야 할 돈만 받을 거야!","source_cn":"喂！拿走你的臭钱！我们现在不是劫匪了！只拿该拿的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29982563C34EA77D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1223205013:1":{"text":"의외로 규칙을 지키는 녀석들이었군. 내가 너희를 얕봤어.","source_cn":"没想到你们还挺有原则，小看你们了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74C7C3C4FCD37E18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1223205014:1":{"text":"보긴 뭘 봐, 썩 꺼져!","source_cn":"看什么看，快滚！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACFE0F4C71136475","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1223205015:1":{"text":"흥, 아무리 바뀌어도 한번 물귀신은 평생 물귀신이지. 받아들여!","source_cn":"哼，再怎么变，一天是水鬼，一辈子都是水鬼，认命吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x399451B41BB69DE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1223205016:1":{"text":"에잇, 참! 다들 사람 무시하고 침 뱉고 욕하고! 대체 이건 언제 끝나는 거야?","source_cn":"真烦！一个两个的，都朝老子吐口水，什么时候是个头？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4112795DCA7A71C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1223205017:1":{"text":"조금만 더 참아. 바다에는 언젠가 태양이 뜨는 법이야. 우리는 기다리는 데 도가 튼 사람들이잖아?","source_cn":"耐心一点，海上的太阳总会升起。咱们最擅长的，不就是等太...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41714B7D1AC3874B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1223205018:1":{"text":"아, 세실은? 함께 있지 않았나?","source_cn":"对了，西索呢，不是和你在一起吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22656DA0766FA5F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1223205019:1":{"text":"다른 쪽으로 일자리를 찾으러 갔어. 이렇게 안 오는 걸 보면 아마도 시비가 걸린 모양이지.","source_cn":"他去另外一条街找活了，这么久不回来，八成也碰到挑事情的了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E3B5848501C3E9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1223205020:1":{"text":"그에게 가보자고. 길을 안내해 줘.","source_cn":"去看看他，你带路。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C0BB5954327A056","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蛮横的混混":{"text":"건달","source":"蛮横的混混","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:水鬼帮梭罗":{"text":"솔로","source":"水鬼帮梭罗","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:水鬼帮阿尔":{"text":"물귀신파 아르","source":"水鬼帮阿尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":21,"localized_text_count":20,"speaker_count":5}}